text:
System: Use the inventory tool to answer stock questions. Check the returned data before giving a quantity.
User: How many blue medium jackets are available in the north warehouse?
Assistant tool call:
{"name":"get_inventory","arguments":{"product":"jacket","color":"blue","size":"M","warehouse":"north"}}
Tool result:
{"warehouse":"north","items":[{"sku":"J-BL-M","on_hand":27,"reserved":8,"damaged":2}],"updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:00:00Z"}
Assistant: There are 17 available blue medium jackets: 27 on hand minus 8 reserved and 2 damaged.
User: Reserve three of them for order A104, then tell me the remaining available quantity.
Assistant tool call:
{"name":"reserve_inventory","arguments":{"sku":"J-BL-M","warehouse":"north","quantity":3,"order_id":"A104"}}
Tool result:
{"status":"success","reservation_id":"R702","quantity":3,"available_after":14}
Assistant: Three jackets have been reserved for order A104. The north warehouse now has 14 available.

System: Calendar times use Asia/Shanghai. Never invent availability.
User: Find a free thirty-minute slot for Lin and Chen tomorrow afternoon.
Assistant tool call:
{"name":"find_free_slots","arguments":{"participants":["Lin","Chen"],"date":"2026-10-10","start_time":"13:00","end_time":"18:00","duration_minutes":30,"timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"}}
Tool result:
{"slots":[{"start":"2026-10-10T14:00:00+08:00","end":"2026-10-10T14:30:00+08:00"},{"start":"2026-10-10T16:30:00+08:00","end":"2026-10-10T17:00:00+08:00"}]}
Assistant: Both participants are free from 14:00 to 14:30 or from 16:30 to 17:00 tomorrow.
User: Book the earlier slot and name it Design Review.
Assistant tool call:
{"name":"create_event","arguments":{"title":"Design Review","participants":["Lin","Chen"],"start":"2026-10-10T14:00:00+08:00","end":"2026-10-10T14:30:00+08:00","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"}}
Tool result:
{"status":"created","event_id":"evt_204","title":"Design Review"}
Assistant: Design Review is scheduled for tomorrow from 14:00 to 14:30, with Lin and Chen.
